{"id":"898118603bd4cfd4f64d28176d758ecdc93b5cf7","url":"https://hub.baai.ac.cn/view/56670","title":"三分之一arXiv沦陷！CS论文65%被判「AI味」，数学仅0.7% - 智源社区","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":"新智元\n                  2026-07-28 10:20 分享","excerpt":"一项unslop研究分析12750篇arXiv论文（2023年1月—2026年7月）发现：计算机科学领域65%的新论文被AI生成内容检测器标记为疑似AI撰写，而数学领域仅0.7%；整体约三分之一arXiv论文疑似AI生成。该现象引发热议，“大泔水时代”成为网络热词，凸显AI写作在CS领域的泛滥及学科间显著差异，也引发对学术质量与伦理的深切担忧。（150字）","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"js_content\"><h3 data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" data-nest-level=\"2\"><section data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" data-nest-level=\"3\" data-style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(117, 114, 114);white-space: normal;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"246\" data-backw=\"578\" data-imgfileid=\"505230498\" data-ratio=\"0.42643923240938164\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d9023301f5f19c0eae38aafd027778451785205224585.webp\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"2345\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d9023301f5f19c0eae38aafd027778451785205224585.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section></h3><h3 data-nest-level=\"2\"><section data-nest-level=\"3\" data-id=\"88402\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\"><p data-nest-level=\"7\"><span data-nest-level=\"8\"><strong data-nest-level=\"9\"><span data-nest-level=\"10\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"11\">&#160;&#160;</span></span></strong><strong data-nest-level=\"9\"><span data-nest-level=\"10\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"11\">新智元报道 &#160;</span></span></strong></span></p></section></h3><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" data-nest-level=\"2\"><p data-nest-level=\"5\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"6\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3b253ef41422b4d012484a3c9cacf4e71785205224585.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.06944444444444445\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"40\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"40\" data-imgfileid=\"505218218\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3b253ef41422b4d012484a3c9cacf4e71785205224585.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai26o\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">三分之一的arXiv论文，竟然是AI写的？</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1ixf\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">就在最近，一份unslop的研究在外网炸开了锅。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai24e2\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">过去一年，计算机科学领域65%的新论文，被它的检测器标了红。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai20qs\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">网友甚至为此造了一个专属名词——「大泔水时代」。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai62d\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">可同一时期的数学论文，却只有0.7%。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"352\" data-backw=\"562\" data-height=\"940\" data-imgfileid=\"505230491\" data-ratio=\"0.6266666666666667\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/5f591d6d612ae32f202c1ce86f012c6e1785205224585.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1500\" data-width=\"1500\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/5f591d6d612ae32f202c1ce86f012c6e1785205224585.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001785205224585.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001785205224585.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section data-nest-level=\"2\"><span data-nest-level=\"3\"><strong data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">ChatGPT一响，曲线原地起飞</span></strong></span></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1lcw\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">在这项研究中，团队扫了12750篇arXiv论文，时间跨度从2023年1月直抵2026年7月。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xaihcj\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">目标锁定十个学科，每个领域每月抽取约25怕篇全文。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai6og\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">对照组则选定在2021至2022年，那是ChatGPT还未降生的纯人类时代。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/42e8224dd965688ab20c184e4620e1851785205224585.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.4278892072588348\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1047\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"247\" data-imgfileid=\"505230505\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/42e8224dd965688ab20c184e4620e1851785205224585.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai3lb\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">结果显示，2021至2022年，标记率稳定在0.4%；但随着ChatGPT的发布，曲线在几个月内拔地而起。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai4en\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">在最近一个完整季度中，标记率达到了32%，而在2026年初，峰值更是逼近39%。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/49009f6958a4ec6697048ea3b007f3ec1785205224586.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5549382716049382\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1620\" data-width=\"1620\" data-height=\"899\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"312\" data-imgfileid=\"505230490\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/49009f6958a4ec6697048ea3b007f3ec1785205224586.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1mug\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">分学科来看，计算机科学最为惨烈，标记率高达65%。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xaijfn\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">要知道在ChatGPT问世前，它的底数只有0.2%。短短三年，数字狂飙了300多倍。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1eqg\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">紧随其后的是定量生物56.3%，电气工程51.3%，经济金融47%；再往下，应用物理34%，统计31.3%，凝聚态24%，高能物理14%，天体物理10.7%。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai172p\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">榜单的最后一行是数学：0.7%。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai11z2\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">而这还只是下限。如果把AI文本藏得足够隐蔽，检测器是识别不出来的。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/a206d6222c2578a001ff348b1ab382ff1785205224586.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5496613995485328\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"886\" data-width=\"886\" data-height=\"487\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"309\" data-imgfileid=\"505230487\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/a206d6222c2578a001ff348b1ab382ff1785205224586.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1p7j\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">同一台检测仪，同一个论文库，落差逼近100倍。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1ktp\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">到底是数学家集体坚守纯手工码字？还是这台机器在数学公式面前，压根就是个瞎子？</span></span></p><section data-nest-level=\"2\"><p data-nest-level=\"3\"><strong data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1785205224586.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"505100592\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1785205224586.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></strong></p></section><section data-nest-level=\"2\"><span data-nest-level=\"3\"><strong data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">跌入谷底的0.7%，是机器致盲</span></strong></span></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1nuk\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">其实，谜底已经被unslop亲手写进了报告里。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1idu\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">想想看，一篇标准的数学论文究竟长什么样？满屏都是符号、公式、定理与证明，真正用英语写成的散文句子，少得可怜。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1mil\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">偏偏这台检测器只认文字。它盯的是句子的结构、用词的习惯、段落的组织。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xaispl\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">而数学论文里仅剩的那几行字，还全是「设X为某某」「由引理3可推导」这类格式化表达，和检测器训练时见过的科学英语基本不在同一个频道上。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xaik5d\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">所以团队自己也承认，目前的研究还有不少局限性：</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xaiw11\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">数学的0.7%目前还说明不了什么。可能是数学家真不怎么用AI，也可能是检测器看不懂数学论文，但这份数据分不出是哪一种。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1f47\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">对照组也比较小。每个学科只有200篇ChatGPT前的论文，按0.4%的误报率，2000篇里总共只有8篇被标记。这种水平，只能算是粗略估计。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1cb6\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">再有就是前面说过的，检测器抓不全。所以，这些数字都还只是下限，真实比例只会更高。</span></span></p><section data-nest-level=\"2\"><p data-nest-level=\"3\"><strong data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1785205224586.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"505100592\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1785205224586.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></strong></p></section><section data-nest-level=\"2\"><span data-nest-level=\"3\"><strong data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">越卷的地方，越离不开AI</span></strong></span></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1l53\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">那么，到底是谁在用AI写论文？</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1751\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">答案，藏在斯坦福另一组测了两年的数据里。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1yu\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">2024年3月，斯坦福Weixin Liang团队率先把尺子伸进同行评审：ICLR 2024的审稿意见里，约10.6%的句子被LLM大幅修改过。论文还没测完，审稿人自己先用上了。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1k2f\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">2025年8月，还是这个团队，把样本扩到112万篇论文，并且直接登上了《自然·人类行为》。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai21ol\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">研究显示，截至2024年9月，CS论文摘要的LLM修改比例最高已达22.5%。而且用得最狠的，是发预印本最勤、扎在最卷领域的研究者。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/248e9dbae58fcbfbd692f629908ca24f1785205224586.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.4062772449869224\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1147\" data-width=\"1147\" data-height=\"466\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"228\" data-imgfileid=\"505230489\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/248e9dbae58fcbfbd692f629908ca24f1785205224586.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai3sz\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">越卷的领域，用得越狠。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1y3w\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">在这里，AI写作已经成为了军备竞赛：</span>同行都在用AI提速，只用手写的人，节奏就慢了一拍。</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1zp4\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">难怪这份报告在X上流传颇广的一条转发，配文里第一行就是：「提示词：写一篇能发arXiv的论文。」</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/cdd897a73b3f96599c4ecf2640f08c301785205224586.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.6309278350515464\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"970\" data-width=\"970\" data-height=\"612\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"355\" data-imgfileid=\"505230493\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/cdd897a73b3f96599c4ecf2640f08c301785205224586.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001785205224586.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001785205224586.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section data-nest-level=\"2\"><span data-nest-level=\"3\"><strong data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">它闻的是「味」，不是AI</span></strong></span></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1fsh\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">不过，先别急着拿这65%去定罪。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1pow\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">团队在报告里也承认，检测器分不清「AI顺过一遍语法」和「整篇机器代工」，它只认文字里的机器味浓度。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xaiptg\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">所以65%的准确读法，是「65%的论文闻起来像AI」，而不是「65%的论文是AI写的」。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1swq\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">但麻烦在于，这种机器味，人类自己也会沾染。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xaifqb\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">有不信邪的研究者，把自己多年前的旧论文扔进检测工具，结果27%到74%的内容被标红。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1wj0\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">要知道在那个年代，ChatGPT连个影子都还没有。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/036aa72b2bd28e94812b1b342608fd0c1785205224586.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.6804326450344149\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2034\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"393\" data-imgfileid=\"505230508\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/036aa72b2bd28e94812b1b342608fd0c1785205224586.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai14eh\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">原因不难找。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1yka\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">翻开今天的学术期刊，满纸都是大型语言模型、基准测试、业界最前沿。措辞越标准，结构越工整，越容易撞上检测器认定的机器特征。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1hu\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">何况，LLM本来就是拿这类论文训练出来的。不是学者写得像AI，是AI生来就写得像学者。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/0858ddbe96cade3c89f66df4961a01b91785205224586.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.47024390243902436\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2050\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"272\" data-imgfileid=\"505230522\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/0858ddbe96cade3c89f66df4961a01b91785205224586.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section data-nest-level=\"2\"><p data-nest-level=\"3\"><strong data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1785205224586.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"505100592\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1785205224586.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></strong></p></section><section data-nest-level=\"2\"><span data-nest-level=\"3\"><strong data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">当所有文字都有了嫌疑</span></strong></span></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xaih9b\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">其实这两年，我们都在干和检测器同一件事。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1z2p\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">读到一段四平八稳、词句工整、是不是「不仅……而且……」的文字，心里就会咯噔一下：这怕不是AI写的吧？</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1atk\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">unslop的检测器，等于把这种玄学的嗅觉，做成了一台能量产数字的仪器。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai18bs\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">毕竟怀疑一旦装进脑子，就卸不掉了。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xaino1\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">过去，「写下来」本身就是一种背书。一个人愿意花几个小时组织文字，至少说明他认真。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xaisru\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">现在写得再漂亮，都可能只换来一句「AI吧」。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai1dku\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">有些人甚至开始刻意绕开自己用了半辈子的词，只因它们「听起来太AI」。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d05a71e3202f014c1635a3b04d1162ca1785205224586.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.7486985328916232\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2113\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"433\" data-imgfileid=\"505230514\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d05a71e3202f014c1635a3b04d1162ca1785205224586.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai231t\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">如今，「AI味」正在变成一场席卷文字圈的新型原罪。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mru74xai11sk\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><span textstyle=\"\">滑稽的是，直到今天，我们连这股原罪由什么构成，都还没能精确测量出来。</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">参考资料：</span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\"><br></span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">https://unslop.run/blog/measuring-ai-writing-on-arxiv</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">编辑：摩西</span></span></p><section data-nest-level=\"2\"><span data-nest-level=\"3\"><strong data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">秒追ASI</span></strong></span></section><section data-nest-level=\"2\"><span data-nest-level=\"3\"><strong data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">⭐</span></strong><strong data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">点赞、转发、在看一键三连</span></strong><strong data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">⭐</span></strong></span></section><section data-nest-level=\"2\"><span data-nest-level=\"3\"><strong data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！</span></strong></span></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4d80689a0a4e5d39176224ba829acc3e1785205224586.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.2111111111111111\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"122\" data-imgfileid=\"505133683\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4d80689a0a4e5d39176224ba829acc3e1785205224586.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><section data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/50d0834dc7435040000e52c792d62ad01785205224587.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.6129629629629629\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"355\" data-imgfileid=\"505229036\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/50d0834dc7435040000e52c792d62ad01785205224587.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section></div></DIV>","content_text":"新智元报道 三分之一的arXiv论文，竟然是AI写的？就在最近，一份unslop的研究在外网炸开了锅。过去一年，计算机科学领域65%的新论文，被它的检测器标了红。网友甚至为此造了一个专属名词——「大泔水时代」。可同一时期的数学论文，却只有0.7%。ChatGPT一响，曲线原地起飞在这项研究中，团队扫了12750篇arXiv论文，时间跨度从2023年1月直抵2026年7月。目标锁定十个学科，每个领域每月抽取约25怕篇全文。对照组则选定在2021至2022年，那是ChatGPT还未降生的纯人类时代。结果显示，2021至2022年，标记率稳定在0.4%；但随着ChatGPT的发布，曲线在几个月内拔地而起。在最近一个完整季度中，标记率达到了32%，而在2026年初，峰值更是逼近39%。分学科来看，计算机科学最为惨烈，标记率高达65%。要知道在ChatGPT问世前，它的底数只有0.2%。短短三年，数字狂飙了300多倍。紧随其后的是定量生物56.3%，电气工程51.3%，经济金融47%；再往下，应用物理34%，统计31.3%，凝聚态24%，高能物理14%，天体物理10.7%。榜单的最后一行是数学：0.7%。而这还只是下限。如果把AI文本藏得足够隐蔽，检测器是识别不出来的。同一台检测仪，同一个论文库，落差逼近100倍。到底是数学家集体坚守纯手工码字？还是这台机器在数学公式面前，压根就是个瞎子？跌入谷底的0.7%，是机器致盲其实，谜底已经被unslop亲手写进了报告里。想想看，一篇标准的数学论文究竟长什么样？满屏都是符号、公式、定理与证明，真正用英语写成的散文句子，少得可怜。偏偏这台检测器只认文字。它盯的是句子的结构、用词的习惯、段落的组织。而数学论文里仅剩的那几行字，还全是「设X为某某」「由引理3可推导」这类格式化表达，和检测器训练时见过的科学英语基本不在同一个频道上。所以团队自己也承认，目前的研究还有不少局限性：数学的0.7%目前还说明不了什么。可能是数学家真不怎么用AI，也可能是检测器看不懂数学论文，但这份数据分不出是哪一种。对照组也比较小。每个学科只有200篇ChatGPT前的论文，按0.4%的误报率，2000篇里总共只有8篇被标记。这种水平，只能算是粗略估计。再有就是前面说过的，检测器抓不全。所以，这些数字都还只是下限，真实比例只会更高。越卷的地方，越离不开AI那么，到底是谁在用AI写论文？答案，藏在斯坦福另一组测了两年的数据里。2024年3月，斯坦福Weixin Liang团队率先把尺子伸进同行评审：ICLR 2024的审稿意见里，约10.6%的句子被LLM大幅修改过。论文还没测完，审稿人自己先用上了。2025年8月，还是这个团队，把样本扩到112万篇论文，并且直接登上了《自然·人类行为》。研究显示，截至2024年9月，CS论文摘要的LLM修改比例最高已达22.5%。而且用得最狠的，是发预印本最勤、扎在最卷领域的研究者。越卷的领域，用得越狠。在这里，AI写作已经成为了军备竞赛：同行都在用AI提速，只用手写的人，节奏就慢了一拍。难怪这份报告在X上流传颇广的一条转发，配文里第一行就是：「提示词：写一篇能发arXiv的论文。」它闻的是「味」，不是AI不过，先别急着拿这65%去定罪。团队在报告里也承认，检测器分不清「AI顺过一遍语法」和「整篇机器代工」，它只认文字里的机器味浓度。所以65%的准确读法，是「65%的论文闻起来像AI」，而不是「65%的论文是AI写的」。但麻烦在于，这种机器味，人类自己也会沾染。有不信邪的研究者，把自己多年前的旧论文扔进检测工具，结果27%到74%的内容被标红。要知道在那个年代，ChatGPT连个影子都还没有。原因不难找。翻开今天的学术期刊，满纸都是大型语言模型、基准测试、业界最前沿。措辞越标准，结构越工整，越容易撞上检测器认定的机器特征。何况，LLM本来就是拿这类论文训练出来的。不是学者写得像AI，是AI生来就写得像学者。当所有文字都有了嫌疑其实这两年，我们都在干和检测器同一件事。读到一段四平八稳、词句工整、是不是「不仅……而且……」的文字，心里就会咯噔一下：这怕不是AI写的吧？unslop的检测器，等于把这种玄学的嗅觉，做成了一台能量产数字的仪器。毕竟怀疑一旦装进脑子，就卸不掉了。过去，「写下来」本身就是一种背书。一个人愿意花几个小时组织文字，至少说明他认真。现在写得再漂亮，都可能只换来一句「AI吧」。有些人甚至开始刻意绕开自己用了半辈子的词，只因它们「听起来太AI」。如今，「AI味」正在变成一场席卷文字圈的新型原罪。滑稽的是，直到今天，我们连这股原罪由什么构成，都还没能精确测量出来。参考资料：https://unslop.run/blog/measuring-ai-writing-on-arxiv编辑：摩西秒追ASI⭐点赞、转发、在看一键三连⭐点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！","fetched_at":"2026-07-29T03:07:50.247Z","ok":true}